earance, she has a very strong sex drive. She also longs for the kind of intense, all-night sex she used to have in the past."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Translated from at-sakura.net"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c44936"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"康の妻で、派遣で某企業で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はスーツの下に隠れているが、モデル顔負けのスタイルの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然が入っていて、周囲の人をほんわかした気持ちにさせてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性経験は康のみ。愛あるエッチに満足していた。筈だった。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8877","sourceWorkId":"16782","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の妻で、派遣で某企業で働いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"普段はスーツの下に隠れているが、モデル顔負けのスタイルの持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"少し天然が入っていて、周囲の人をほんわかした気持ちにさせてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男性経験は夫のみ。愛あるエッチに満足していた…筈だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"※メガネオプションは着脱可能。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"58237"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d8/d8ac8f73955b0f9f9bd5bc734378c06087de7b016bdf2303b6257466f6dbb6b6.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6a/6ae05adaa601d23bd708b7dac9828e9b07ff74e5c386171f0fde7533a514a18f.webp","width":192,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長谷川知子","creatorId":"vndb:s694","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s694","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s694","name":"ひむろゆり(氷室百合)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:227021:58237:5924:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c109504","characterName":"指原 康","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c109504"},"originalCharacterName":"指原 康","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mariko's husband who works in the video game industry. He has recently noticed his wife giving him a cold shoulder, and starts to suspect her of cheating. The truth comes out once he confronts her about his suspicions."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c109504"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c79977","characterName":"岡田 一樹","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c79977"},"originalCharacterName":"岡田 一樹","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Mariko’s superior at work. Handsome, successful, and knows how to get what he wants. He’s particularly gifted in bed, owing to his prodigious equipment and difficulty achieving climax."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He sets his sights on Mariko, in an attempt to steal her away from her husband. The fantastic sex is enough to keep her coming back, but will it win her heart as well?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"He has sex with Mariko several times, many of which are witnessed by her husband. During one session, he ejaculates so hard that he convulses and shakes while holding Mariko, riding out his powerful orgasm. Ooh la la, what a naughty boy!"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c79977"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a8bca94c69cb0aa8ed591b729265b988e8a69c796b5c50467caad9435dcbd5b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0c/0cb2e2448c3716b6d0ea700aa00e8e5e1b56a79301eb822e65a465028e986e37.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"egs:brand:2906","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:2906","canonicalEntityId":"egs:brand:2906","name":"アトリエ